<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Staff access deactivated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Account notice
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your Dukka staff account for <strong>{{email}}</strong> has been deactivated. You no longer have access to the staff portal or assigned market tools.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Staff email" value=email}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Deactivated"}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Believe this is a mistake?"}}
  Contact a Dukka administrator and ask them to review your account status. Only an administrator can restore access.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Thank you for the work you contributed while your account was active.
</p>
